# Normalise line endings for text, and keep binaries byte-exact.
#
# This repository is developed on Windows with core.autocrlf=true. Without the
# rules below, git classifies a file it cannot prove is binary as text and
# rewrites LF to CRLF on checkout. For a PDF that silently corrupts the file —
# the committed blob stays correct, but every fresh clone writes a broken copy
# to disk. Marking them binary suppresses both conversion and diffing.

* text=auto

*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
